# Jw_cad itself is Jiro Shimizu & Yoshifumi Tanaka's.  Its licence allows
# passing it on, on two conditions: do not change the program, and pass it on
# in the form it came in (Jw_win.txt, section 3).  So the installer is here
# exactly as it is downloaded -- jww10036.exe, an unmodified Inno Setup
# package -- and the expanded tree is not: orig/ is what the installer makes
# locally, and decomp/ is machine output taken from the program, which is
# neither unchanged nor the form it came in.  README.md says how to make both.
orig/
decomp/
install.log

tmp/
__pycache__/
*.o
tests/*.exe

# generated from your own copy of Jw_win.exe by tools/mkres.py and
# tools/btnmap.py -- machine output from someone else's program
src/gen/
tests/out/
jw_port.exe
